JAK 26.5.3:

Bug Fixes:
[x] Fix mouse being able to wipe screen

Kernel Tweaks:
[x] Add expansion card detection (not initializing yet)
[x] Improve memory management (fixed 64 KiB heap with aligned allocation/free)

Features:
[x] Add vSH (custom Bash shell)
[x] Rename RTCI to plugins
[x] Add additional support for plugins (kernel-registered handlers)
[x] Add compatibility to the GRUB bootloader (Multiboot 1/2)
[x] Add configure compatibility for GRUB

JAK 26.6a - Graphics:

Bug Fixes:
[x] Mouse doesnt appear in GUI demo

Kernel Tweaks:
[x] Optimize clipped framebuffer rectangle fills with pitch-aware fast paths

Features:
[x] Add basic framebuffer windows, labels, buttons, and a vSH `gui-demo` command

Experimental Features:
[x] Prototype an optimized software renderer (no hardware acceleration)

